<title>USA: Grupo Televisa chairman on medical leave.</title>
<headline>Grupo Televisa chairman on medical leave.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-02-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Grupo Televisa SA said Thursday that its Chairman and President Emilio Azcrraga Milmo has taken a leave of absence for medical care in Los Angeles.</p>
<p>In his absence, the company said, Executive Vice President and Chief Operating Officer Emilio Azcrraga Jean will be responsible for broadcasting operations and Guillermo Caedo White, executive vice president and chief financial officer, will oversee administrative and corporate affairs.</p>
</text>
